[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- NEVER kill processes by name (`killall`, `pkill -f`, `ps aux | grep ... | xargs kill`). This kills OTHER runs' processes.[39m                                                                           [49m
[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- NEVER monitor processes by name (`ps aux | grep method.py`). You will see other runs' processes and get confused.[39m                                                                                   [49m
